         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Like You\n\nObserve the hands below: they are not the only part of our body that we have duplicated.\n\nWe have two hands, two feet, two eyes, and two ears — our body is full of pairs! Each hand has 5 fingers, and we have two hands, so our fingers form two groups of 5: 5 + 5 = 10.\n\nPairs like these are exactly what multiplying by two is about: taking a number and doubling it, one pair at a time.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
